#: ../../.hero/planning/initiatives/hvm-13-cluster-docs/spec.md:15
msgid ""
"HVM clusters in Morpheus 9.0 replace Pacemaker with an agent-based quorum"
" system (Corosync + DLM + Morpheus agent QuorumCheckService). GFS2 is "
"renamed to \"HPE Clustered Datastore (Shared LUN)\". Layout 1.3 "
"diagnostics no longer use `pcs` commands."
msgstr ""

